      <li><a href="http://english.mofcom.gov.cn/">China Ministry of Commerce (MOFCOM)</a> &mdash; official trade and industrial-policy reference for export-oriented manufacturing.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Cluster descriptions on this page are directional research, not a substitute for verifying the individual factory. {RELATIONSHIP}</p>


